# G17: the recovery question on the graphics screen: the same words in a dialog of bevelled buttons, the focus moved with Tab, and a
# click on Recover. The copy is the old QUILL.RCV in `RECOVER\`.
@recovery
@copy quill.rcv RECOVER\
@stamp RECOVER\QUILL.RCV 2025-01-01 00:00
tab
@click 130 280        # Recover
